review_comments:
I think it is right.

cdc_acm_fifo_fill() will not accept data. 

```
	if (!dev_data->configured || dev_data->suspended) {
		LOG_WRN("Device not configured or suspended, drop %d bytes",
			len);
		return 0;
	}
```

This cause an inifinte loop when using cdc_acm_irq_tx_ready() as in
zephyr/samples/subsys/usb/cdc_acm/src/main.c interrupt_handler() and many other projects.
